- Open Control Panel > Programs and Features
- Locate "Microsoft SQL Server 2016 LocalDB" in the installed programs list
- Right-click and select Uninstall
- Follow the uninstallation wizard to complete the removal
- Restart the server if required to complete file cleanup
- Confirm the server is back online and accessible
